  "notes": "Image shows a Nano ESP32 seated on the Alvik with a row of Alvik holes beside each Nano row; only five Alvik holes carry callouts (3V3, GND, PWR_Status on top; GND, VIN on bottom). The pad in column 12 of the top row and column 14 of the bottom row has a blank white silkscreen box; label GND taken from the Alvik callout. The 3V3 callout lands on the hole beside Nano pin D2, and PWR_Status beside RX0, as drawn; this was transcribed without interpretation."
